{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本票選女優「最強美顏」榜單出爐！「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓河北彩花、瀨戶環奈奪奪冠，三上悠亞退役仍躋身五強｜日本成人影音平台 FANZA 近期舉辦一場別開生面的大型顏值票選活動，主打「不看作品，只拼臉蛋」。這場票選集結多達 1,182 位女優，採用殘酷的「一對一二選一」對決機制，網友必須通過多輪淘汰賽，讓系統計算出個人專屬的理想臉孔榜單。賽事推出後瞬間風靡網路，累計超過 7.6 萬名網友參與投票，選出心目中的「神顏巨星」。</p><p>「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓群芳奪冠 河北彩花以些微差距屈居亞軍</p><p>經過超過 7.6 萬次殘酷對決，被粉絲封為「可愛天花板」的石川澪（ Mio Ishikawa），今年年僅 22 歲的石川澪以清純甜美的鄰家女孩氣質著稱，精緻五官搭配標誌性的療癒微笑，加上兩年前與非法成人片網頁MissAV「對著幹」反盜版，早已在日本及海外積攢超高人氣。</p><figure><img alt=\"「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓群芳奪冠\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183778995028627456861492.jpeg/IAxkR0bCXjSkeCYsEXCeRHI0c1NE704GNeZv9zXmb_c\"/><figcaption>「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓群芳奪冠</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126436317958144384721.jpeg/elN61KS4MtsVwhzUyQS7fNYj5E_ICTiIKaPs8Cmj7PA\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126434463944704759234.jpeg/D6sezhfUqXsfTaaDTdnwW_THlwQYwl1A0AaNZNAGjWQ\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126430806249472497206.jpeg/Cdgy_X_ZZIFFxhkDwD7s7ohkdVNy8fqfemx7OHpsezg\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126432614125568527941.jpeg/UPoo8h_Bv-v9QxaWVbojJh1CZ9hhMYluKGIEuShiBLk\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126434375733248276495.jpeg/QonU4Gf_YktJpMl9qHyRCNNh-VOda-R06xbN1OsWzdQ\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126436938584064012986.jpeg/zPDrNgngVZY3qtIL1NBwre5qU9HxFRQQxS3cicUt3Ik\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126439472074752359168.jpeg/ShJ_dBw2klw48yE6QUEWjz1N0yQMzxhW8gXRkfIF0ZE\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126427782025216278456.jpeg/2PEeu5fc-2GsTmff-HhIDKEEG-V6vr7lIuOJgyLjiYM\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126435667709952958016.jpeg/23UKE8aV7Pf40a003gM0RZ1f8Bseu7x153hH0ud4R9I\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126437714661376617498.jpeg/8nouZ8HNzlSXgPkDF47mdTiPFlFrPIBujv32WI799lg\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126428717355008243519.jpeg/yH1wbsKOLRXlLn7u5dKbRVIAQLfMDYRY85Xj7vOV4-4\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126431443783680019748.jpeg/qEUklxXJs6Nu-B1uxbY9LCKMcIg3VqyOKMGjeCjBo3g\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126438385750016857324.jpeg/cXdjplSHORXQPn-Ly2WIPH1PKdiTksIYbeRMO23kTDs\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126428243398656798561.jpeg/BZw-C2NxNXkwzsLX1sc1Y4cavzJFtMAjQSslA0ErJQM\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126430709780480520468.jpeg/UDm1Pc33Ry0PbWK0vbKd4mg3BQj9h8JY0a6oR9GuqEc\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126433306185728460237.jpeg/NmeRoUue1DsOCYozvKevhP0LEIT-Vc5brIveUqyL3lI\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126428625080320718536.jpeg/lj1wJ2IW17B0UNdqEOm0cQYzmc0d7uvb7j4l4u4-JeI\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126431443783680305249.jpeg/Vqn8u6U9gci9sRYnlTQssKUFIvlcuRuEhkWr3YZFq90\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126434279264256428930.jpeg/jVlWxP_kMJPUiM0Lqsb_gYFSLMI4se4RTV2j601do-s\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250427/993126436460433408936207.jpeg/RZEj9Ce3fDps9SBFn8z0rk1QV6dvCTcY0lICUtJSAlI\"/><figcaption>石川澪（IG@ishikawa._.mio）</figcaption></figure><p>石川澪出道至今皆以「偶像級顏值」取勝，即使只有A Cup 身材，被網民奉為：「這逆天神顏，去做偶像歌手、指青春劇也沒有問題。」，今次投票根本為她而設，輕鬆登上顏值冠軍寶座。</p><figure><img alt=\"「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓群芳奪冠 河北彩花以些微差距屈居亞軍\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183782379907452928593640.jpeg/ksxHr7O4Kp53fweE6IQO2EHvn69bjtopoK_JI6CvySM\"/><figcaption>「可愛天花板」石川澪力壓群芳奪冠 河北彩花以些微差距屈居亞軍</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232444044906496089532.jpeg/22erZGAOxWDiCKdQSQZehzECekR_BwNRIhQ0bSIUNG0\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232446481928192257639.jpeg/NslD2mPDBLPH9TUIIL8L0a0tDtqlwkRwGCCXLxggly8\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232448545656832697528.jpeg/5w_r9fPwg38igdO4TBl-A_x3j7KJwMybF0TaVhdE2lY\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232450600996864491503.jpeg/EM-brEwqOLKwE4CS3znoH7U0FpuFk6a64gz5feIM-X0\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232453197402112378915.jpeg/3nTU0nG1UOmeOuXhspJFh4_wnd5UC4nKWjNgs1ozYLM\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232446519676928417206.jpeg/YM-stuRcYHpEDoJMgjGId7Roa1pqOf2dS_p1UUv6dVE\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"IG@ishikawa._.mio\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250115/956232449057361920851036.jpeg/R8KtlzLe49U7GIfHpOT2qf2kpf-e_Z0UQGP8CUBj_Ak\"/><figcaption>IG@ishikawa._.mio</figcaption></figure><p>由於冠軍根本沒有懸念，網民著眼點自然落於亞季之爭。在台灣與香港極具影響力的頂流女星河北彩花（Saika Kawakita），女朋友形像非常入屋，以些微差距暫居亞軍。</p><figure><img alt=\"在台灣與香港極具影響力的頂流女星河北彩花（Saika Kawakita），女朋友形像非常入屋，以些微差距暫居亞軍。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183780517170909184396872.jpeg/sF5MkuhMlpvxNPCSbVo17tBLAz40wnWPPYWbCT2Fmwk\"/><figcaption>在台灣與香港極具影響力的頂流女星河北彩花（Saika Kawakita），女朋友形像非常入屋，以些微差距暫居亞軍。</figcaption></figure><p>獲得季軍的則被譽為最強新生代女優的瀨戶環奈（Kanna Seto），精緻如雕琢般的五官讓她一登場就吸引大批顏控粉絲。</p><figure><img alt=\"獲得季軍的則被譽為最強新生代女優的瀨戶環奈（Kanna Seto）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183780712315097088718492.jpeg/T-SKqxCRiDsi0tKrdNLQTS34yXyA8dGVJzKymycysps\"/><figcaption>獲得季軍的則被譽為最強新生代女優的瀨戶環奈（Kanna Seto）</figcaption></figure><p>三上悠亞退役仍穩居第五 前十名榜單星光熠熠</p><p>第 4 至第 10 名依次為七澤米亞（七澤みあ）、三上悠亞（三上悠亜）、逢澤美優（逢澤みゆ）、新有菜（Arina Arata）、宮下玲奈（宮下玲奈）、美谷朱音（美谷朱音）以及櫻空桃（櫻空もも）。最讓外界驚喜的是第 5 名的三上悠亞。這位早已引退轉型進入主流娛樂圈的前輩，憑藉轉戰 Instagram 與 YouTube 累積的跨國影響力，依然在純顏值對決中高踞前五名。</p><figure><img alt=\"第4位：七澤米亞\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781297307258880635290.jpeg/vWGWtMiYKim9pPEJoFVZIkDhGQQLXa6hW9UEnFvVBJw\"/><figcaption>第4位：七澤米亞</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第5位：三上悠亞\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781299912052736739125.jpeg/raqsQhYtcJGwcasnhcq0uoU9F9_gnRhY9VZZjvVWWY4\"/><figcaption>第5位：三上悠亞</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第6位：逢澤美優\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781301979975680786130.jpeg/g_xGKrUrzKrr0gjzIYH8wcH0W1tSr6qDwgZyN8IGcjc\"/><figcaption>第6位：逢澤美優</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第 7 位：新有菜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781305268441088768493.jpeg/_P41_j2nud5eXo4LufVnD5RrWHneLhGjqoJRVaqCUVU\"/><figcaption>第 7 位：新有菜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第 8 位：宮下玲奈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781307327975424670498.jpeg/IuRwsj1Oq8UPdrUitK09hkMQAgZtPCgVFA7C1BQOwtQ\"/><figcaption>第 8 位：宮下玲奈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第 9 位：美谷朱音\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781297009463296198637.jpeg/d0GcD6d9WgJzXB7nz9ZcM3FrlzZB0oGknafsHZ2n7B0\"/><figcaption>第 9 位：美谷朱音</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第10 位：櫻空桃\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183781299421319168637928.jpeg/_QtvaBmluUmC0WMT7Q2nMjXGrVKdPXtqqaDOLqmgzi4\"/><figcaption>第10 位：櫻空桃</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183782614452932608687423.jpeg/OBLjPjYxhCe_IXMkTc4U2KXXYgFgMgXvDrIcbg6yHG4\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T14:20:45.838477+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1610,"images":39,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}